name: Typetone
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/typetone/icon.svg
version: 1.0.0
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: The ultimate typewriter feel — synthesizes a distinct sound for 22 separate editor events (typing, deleting, new lines, formatting, page changes, sidebar actions, theme switches, and more), each toggleable on its own, with a choice of keyboard styles and per-keystroke variation like an iPhone keyboard.
